{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42925","headline":"浔阳观水 · 韩溉","name":"浔阳观水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝宗汉水接阳台，唅呀填坑吼作雷。\n莫见九江平稳去，还从三峡嶮巇来。\n南经梦泽宽浮日，西出岷山劣泛杯。\n直至沧溟涵贮尽，沈深不动浸昭回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩溉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}